		<skos:editorialNote>Project-specific named individual introduced in the RDF/OWL ontology to instantiate controlled CUT competency-question test cases; not adopted from an external terminology source. This named ABox individual is locally constructed test data, not an externally documented instance. The R-column reference supports only the general lexical meaning of the indicated word; it does not substantiate the individual&apos;s particular physical feature assertions, ordinal levels, or expected reasoning result. Concept/term developed for the current ontology; internal artifact history is provenance, not an external literature source. Preferred label is locally assigned for this ontology; no claim of external publication as the label origin.</skos:editorialNote>
		<skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Cut Edge Thickness Requirement</skos:prefLabel>
